    description: "The jsonnet analyzer's calls edge (jsonnet.py ~line 283, evidence_type='tree_sitter') passes a computed confidence that is 1.0 for a resolved local call (0.6 for unresolved), breaching the 0.95 evidence-derived ceiling (ADR-0039). Surfaced adjacent to WI-radim (which fixed the three literal-1.0 sites: meson build_dependency/subdir_include + the jsonnet import edge). DIFFERENT mechanism: the calls confidence is a computed variable, not a dropped literal, so the fix is to cap/derive the resolved-call value in-band (and consider relabeling evidence_type='tree_sitter' to a specific pathway, as WI-radim did for the import edge). Repro: test_extracts_call_edges in packages/hypergumbo-lang-extended1/tests/test_jsonnet.py asserts edge.confidence == 1.0."  # ed39
